# W4-UI-2 V1: an unaffordable placement. Arming never checks affordability (ConstructionMenu::
# click's own doc comment); the refusal comes from the ordinary BuildCmd path once placed, the
# same as any other consumer of it. Run with ANNO_DEV_GOODS_TONS=0 so type 501 (public (0,0),
# cost "wood 3", data/ui/construction.txt) cannot be paid for; the tile (1156, 516) is the same
# proven-free one construction_full_proof.script and settlement_activity.script use.
resize 1024 768
wait frames 5
look 1140 516
key b
wait frames 5
click_px 833 330
wait frames 5
expect title build 501
click 1156 516
wait outcome
expect outcome Refused CannotAfford
quit
